      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.23,
      "end_seconds": 3.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Afternoon, thanks for coming in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.36,
      "end_seconds": 7.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Ah, good morning, doctor, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.4,
      "end_seconds": 11.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Did the receptionist sort you out quickly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.67,
      "end_seconds": 17.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Yes, she was lovely about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.62,
      "end_seconds": 24.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "What's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.2,
      "end_seconds": 34.2,
      "duration_seconds": 9.0,
      "text": "so, mainly a bump on the head yesterday there's a couple of other things, but that's the main one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.22,
      "end_seconds": 39.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.2,
      "end_seconds": 42.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "about... well, about a month"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.75,
      "end_seconds": 61.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any seizure, drowsiness or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.34,
      "end_seconds": 71.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "No seizure, drowsiness or vomiting, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.64,
      "end_seconds": 78.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.98,
      "end_seconds": 84.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.78,
      "end_seconds": 89.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "okay, which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.72,
      "end_seconds": 93.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Thyroxine, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.91,
      "end_seconds": 96.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.85,
      "end_seconds": 103.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.86,
      "text": "75 micrograms. It's a blood thinner, 5 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.54,
      "end_seconds": 118.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.69,
      "end_seconds": 121.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Yes, an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.51,
      "end_seconds": 124.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.52,
      "end_seconds": 129.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I've had an underactive thyroid, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.35,
      "end_seconds": 142.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.23,
      "text": "hm, okay. Yes, an underactive thyroid is known to us, good to have that clear. Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.18,
      "end_seconds": 146.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.44,
      "end_seconds": 150.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.88,
      "end_seconds": 156.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.08,
      "end_seconds": 161.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.22,
      "end_seconds": 164.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "my uncle has high cholesterol"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.06,
      "end_seconds": 175.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.72,
      "end_seconds": 186.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.72,
      "end_seconds": 215.81,
      "duration_seconds": 13.09,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 118 over 78, heart rate 86, weight 89 kilos, SpO2 99 percent on room air, BMI works out to 29.1, height 175 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.66,
      "end_seconds": 218.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.27,
      "end_seconds": 224.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.22,
      "end_seconds": 229.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.15,
      "end_seconds": 233.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "take a deep breath for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.82,
      "end_seconds": 251.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "You are alert and orientated with a small bruise on the forehead and normal limb strength."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.08,
      "end_seconds": 257.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "So, that's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.7,
      "end_seconds": 290.77,
      "duration_seconds": 26.07,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, it fits best with a minor head injury but on a blood thinner, which needs a scan. I want a CT scan of the head done, that's for head injury on anticoagulant. Even though you feel fine, a blood thinner means we scan, delayed bleeding can happen. Let's plan a check today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 292.08,
      "end_seconds": 292.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.56,
      "end_seconds": 301.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.54,
      "end_seconds": 306.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.24,
      "end_seconds": 308.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
